{"kind": "node", "eid": "4:868fd3bf-d668-4594-a0e4-b9572c3d88b1:624", "labels": ["Chunk"], "props": {"section_title": "", "embeddingText": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "source_type": "text", "memory_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93", "_source_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93", "id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93_chunk_0000", "_ontology_name": "fibo", "created_at": "2026-08-02T03:12:12.404604+00:00", "char_start": 0, "_workspace_id": "armv2-c-deepseek-c2373adb", "content_preview": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "token_count": 58, "chunk_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93_chunk_0000", "_ontology_version": "1.0.0", "_ontology_artifact_hash": "e3fc86a281236561", "text": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "embedding_vector_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93_chunk_0000", "status": "active", "document_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca141b93_doc", "source_id": "a8606dbf-6571-4b91-81fb-4501ca